ChatUtils:AddTrans("enUS", "LID_AUTOGUILDINVITE_HELP", "When someone writes \"ginv <word>\", a popup asks whether to invite them to your guild.\n\nWoW only allows guild invites after a mouse click or key press, so this cannot be fully automatic: click Invite in the popup.\n\nEnter the word in the field below. Without a word nothing happens.\nWorks in whisper, say, yell, guild, officer, party, raid, instance and channels. The whole message must be \"ginv <word>\", case does not matter. Your own messages are ignored.\nYou need to be in a guild and allowed to invite.")
